# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4-seats8-262k window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/seats8-262k and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN.
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Every value is final.
# ORDER.txt says the order, each job's stop rule, its minutes and the GO rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-1 is the STAGE-2 image: built by SB9 from the commit
# that records the stage-1 evidence (packed_any_evidence_tp4_262144.json and ordered_writer_evidence_tp4.json at their pins), WITHOUT a baked default: the
# eight-seat 131k image tp4-serve-8 stays what ships until the owner says otherwise. Each job names its profile explicitly. A commit that changes a file the
# image carries needs a new SB9 build and a new tag in every template.
# C9 (STOP, churn under the reservation): sixteen users over eight seats of the 262k audited gate profile - three 253,920, three 200,000, 131,072, 65,536, 32,768,
# 16,384, 8,192, 4,096, then 253,920, 200,000, 131,072 and a short 1,536 - every budget 1,024 with ignore_eos, started 30 s apart. Six long users reserve 21,384 blocks and
# fit; the seventh (131,072: 2,066 more, 23,450) does not and is HELD by the reservation admission until a departure returns its blocks. READ: zero aborts, zero refusals,
# zero engine deaths, every seat answering after the streams; at least eight replacements seen as departures; a 'kv reservation hold' followed by 'released' (else the plan is
# NOT_EXERCISED: a churn that never outran the pool proved nothing); reserved + running <= pool on every KV line; no DRAM hold with a seat free (the rule reads DRAM lines
# only). Duration (estimate): reset 1-3 min; attach 15-40 min; the churn 2-3 hours: 180 / 240 / 300 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-gate
C2_GATE_PLAN=churn
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=253920,253920,253920,200000,200000,200000,131072,65536,32768,16384,8192,4096,253920,200000,131072,1536
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=1024
C2_GATE_JIT=record
